    "title": "Probe loading and validation",
    "summary": "Add the probes package that loads operations.jsonl, queries.jsonl and manifest.json into a domain ProbeSet and validates fields, unique ids, five modalities per concept, phase table, split per concept, queries for every modality pair in each split, query text distinct from stored text and manifest hashes, reporting every failure together.",
